### OS & System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.bak

### IDEs & Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

### Environment & Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### Claude Code Local Overrides
# These files contain your local API tokens, sandbox configs, and personal memory.
# They must never be tracked in the central repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/CLAUDE.local.md

### General Local Overrides
# Catch-all for any other agent's local preference files you might add later.
*.local.json
*.local.md

### MCP & agent configs (real files, not the .example templates)
# These are produced by copying the committed .example files. Consumer projects
# may choose to commit them (env-var values only) or keep them local (inlined
# secrets). For this repo, never commit them — only the .example versions ship.
.mcp.json
opencode.json
kilo.jsonc

### Conversion Script Artifacts
# If you run the conversion scripts locally inside this repo,
# you might want to ignore temporary build or output folders if they are generated.
node_modules/
__pycache__/

### Python build artifacts
# Produced by `pip install ./tools`. Never commit.
tools/*.egg-info/
tools/build/
tools/dist/